WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:01.800
<b>We had CDs released too.</b>

00:01.900 --> 00:05.640
<b>I remember that Party Night
was written</b>

00:05.740 --> 00:09.340
<b>because they wanted a song
to wrap up the events.</b>

00:13.050 --> 00:15.880
<b>So since then,
everything ends with Party Night?</b>

00:15.990 --> 00:21.650
<b>Yes, now we use it
as a song near the end</b>

00:21.760 --> 00:24.780
<b>to get everyone pumped up.</b>

00:26.900 --> 00:29.190
<b>There are dance moves for it,</b>

00:29.770 --> 00:34.600
<b>so the concerts are invigorating
because everyone dances together.</b>

00:48.480 --> 00:52.390
<b>This is the first seasonal
Di Gi Charat episode.</b>

00:53.090 --> 00:55.680
<b>It aired on Christmas Day.</b>

00:55.790 --> 01:01.730
<b>The original air date
was around Christmas time.</b>

01:04.570 --> 01:08.530
<b>This storyboard was made
by a director named Kojima-san,</b>

01:09.210 --> 01:13.770
<b>He directed the anime,
''Master Keaton.''</b>

01:15.510 --> 01:18.310
<b>So the feeling is a little different.</b>

01:35.430 --> 01:37.400
<b>Even Henna Ikimono's box
is Christmasy.</b>

01:37.500 --> 01:38.470
<b>That's true.</b>

01:38.570 --> 01:40.730
<b>A Christmas version.</b>

01:47.440 --> 01:52.900
<b>This episode
and the Party Night episode</b>

01:53.220 --> 01:55.580
<b>were used for Christmas.</b>

01:55.690 --> 01:57.480
<b>Yes, they were.</b>

02:08.830 --> 02:09.960
<b>She's so evil.</b>

02:10.070 --> 02:11.590
<b>Yes she is.</b>

02:14.070 --> 02:15.970
<b>But she has some morals.</b>

02:17.270 --> 02:18.470
<b>This Usada is cute.</b>

02:22.380 --> 02:24.350
<b>''Might'' be morals, huh?</b>

02:24.450 --> 02:27.470
<b>She's probably never felt
remorse before.</b>

02:59.350 --> 03:03.380
<b>There's a heartwarming bell sound
in the back.</b>

03:04.420 --> 03:05.890
<b>So it's relaxing.</b>

03:07.990 --> 03:13.450
<b>Is it supposed to be
a heartwarming story?</b>

03:13.560 --> 03:15.390
<b>This episode?</b>

03:16.830 --> 03:22.770
<b>This is the only episode where
Dejiko is a good person.</b>

03:23.510 --> 03:24.530
<b>Right?</b>

03:36.790 --> 03:38.280
<b>What the-</b>

03:38.390 --> 03:41.190
<b>Everyone thinks, ''Who's that?''</b>

03:45.960 --> 03:48.090
<b>Gamers always gets destroyed
or blown up.</b>

03:48.200 --> 03:49.360
<b>It sure does.</b>

03:49.470 --> 03:51.900
<b>We've been asked</b>

03:52.000 --> 03:58.600
<b>if it's okay to destroy our own store
in our own anime series.</b>

04:00.440 --> 04:04.000
<b>But if the fans enjoy it,
then we'd gladly destroy it.</b>

04:04.280 --> 04:07.680
<b>That's how our president Kidani feels.</b>

04:16.030 --> 04:19.290
<b>So this is the end.</b>

04:19.900 --> 04:23.420
<b>How was it?</b>

04:23.700 --> 04:29.230
<b>I don't know how many times
I said, ''I dunno.''</b>

04:29.340 --> 04:33.430
<b>But I think the unknowns are
what make this anime enjoyable.</b>

04:33.540 --> 04:35.170
<b>That's true.</b>

04:35.950 --> 04:41.250
<b>Hopefully the commentary
was helpful to viewers.</b>

04:41.580 --> 04:45.350
<b>If the fans thought
they'd understand Di Gi Charat more</b>

04:45.450 --> 04:47.320
<b>after watching the commentary,</b>

04:47.420 --> 04:50.760
<b>maybe we didn't meet
their expectations.</b>

04:50.860 --> 04:52.990
<b>Well, now they know that</b>

04:53.100 --> 04:57.400
<b>even the people who created it
don't understand it either.</b>

05:02.510 --> 05:04.630
<b>Thank you to everyone</b>

05:05.810 --> 05:11.510
<b>who bought the Di Gi Charat
Original Series DVD.</b>

05:12.980 --> 05:17.110
<b>Please feel free to comment,</b>

05:17.220 --> 05:23.060
<b>''I don't get it,''
as you watch the anime.</b>

05:23.330 --> 05:29.230
<b>I think that's the best part
of Di Gi Charat, so please enjoy it.</b>

05:43.480 --> 05:47.010
<b>Please buy the rest
of the Di Gi Charat DVDs.</b>

05:48.990 --> 05:54.580
<b>This is the original Di Gi Charat,
so please watch it and enjoy the rest.</b>

05:54.690 --> 05:57.020
<b>Please buy the manga too.
Of course.</b>

05:57.390 --> 05:58.620
<b>Products too.</b>

05:58.730 --> 05:59.720
<b>Of course.</b>

05:59.830 --> 06:01.760
<b>Please support Di Gi Charat
in the future.</b>

06:01.860 --> 06:04.160
<b>Thank you.
Thank you.</b>
